# Copy to `.env` for local development. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# Vars must be prefixed PUBLIC_ to reach the client bundle, which is where the
# map runs. Nothing secret belongs in this file.

# CARTO basemaps API key — https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
#
# CARTO began requiring a key in August 2026. Without one, tiles still load but
# every tile carries a diagonal "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark. A *wrong* key
# produces exactly the same watermarked tile with a 200 response, so check the
# map by eye after changing this, not the network tab.
#
# Free tier: 5M tile requests/calendar month across raster and vector combined,
# for non-commercial use (nonprofits are named as intended users). Attribution
# to CARTO and OpenStreetMap must stay visible — it is set in
# `src/scripts/refresh.ts` on the tile layer; don't remove it.
#
# Set the same value in the Vercel project env (Production + Preview) or the
# deployed site stays watermarked.
PUBLIC_CARTO_KEY=
